  "notes": "Settled from 2025 photos: the tail is the yellow ribbon's loop, not an American flag (both sides; the right side seen in 2023). Simple Flying reported America250 markings added in 2026; no openly licensed 2026 photo shows them, so they aren't drawn. Re-checked 2026-11-15: 'jetBlue' placed as on the standard (measured in metres on the A321neo N2017J and checked on A320s: x 0.174-0.356 of an A320, cap 1.57 m, lowercase 0.76 of the capitals); 'jetblue.com' on the A320's nacelle x 0.43-0.79 (read off N615JB and N627JB); the name under the cockpit given its length.",
